{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A first person twist on the classic game of Minesweeper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's dark, all you have is a torch and a burning desire to clear the room of safe cubes without falling in the goo or getting blown up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>First person Minesweeper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game you know and love, from a different perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802740/extras/fa1db4c1cfbbcf5f20fdb07d517d0955.poster.avif?t=1769031667\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802740/extras/fa1db4c1cfbbcf5f20fdb07d517d0955.webm?t=1769031667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802740/extras/fa1db4c1cfbbcf5f20fdb07d517d0955.mp4?t=1769031667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don't fall into the goo!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleared some safe cubes? Don't fall down the holes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802740/extras/e15ba0d1ab6dd376885e4bded2e43b77.poster.avif?t=1769031667\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802740/extras/e15ba0d1ab6dd376885e4bded2e43b77.webm?t=1769031667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802740/extras/e15ba0d1ab6dd376885e4bded2e43b77.mp4?t=1769031667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Something for everyone!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A range of modes from the regular 10x10 level with 10 mines to &quot;<i>Oh my! This is going to take me weeks, why have you done this?!</i>&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802740/extras/b45e16af6c058eedb46f9b3e77375d84.poster.avif?t=1769031667\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802740/extras/b45e16af6c058eedb46f9b3e77375d84.webm?t=1769031667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802740/extras/b45e16af6c058eedb46f9b3e77375d84.mp4?t=1769031667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Optional overhead mini map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just\u00a0like\u00a0the\u00a0classic game, see the map from above for a little extra help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802740/extras/1ca386673db615907c337a3a9d35a6b2.poster.avif?t=1769031667\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802740/extras/1ca386673db615907c337a3a9d35a6b2.webm?t=1769031667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802740/extras/1ca386673db615907c337a3a9d35a6b2.mp4?t=1769031667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Very optional super secret party mode!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For when you fancy a bit of a rave at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Shh... but you can even use your own music files!)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" 